[TITLE]
CON-09: 10-ac fully impervious subcatchment with 0.2 in depression storage gets
0.1 in of rain at 10 mg/L (wet deposition), so nothing runs off. The
ponded water then evaporates (0.5 in/day). The deposited mass should stay on the
surface (reported as Remaining Buildup), not vanish.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         KINWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
